{
  "about": "What models answered for the notes assistant's catalogue (show_notes_summary, show_note_card), and probes a hostile model, prompt or tool result could send. Recorded runs are replayed through the catalogue's check: each run's attempts in order, the second only when the first was refused. Add a run when a live evaluation records one.",
